.TH EUCLID-CLI-ENS-GET-TOPIC-METADATA 1 "August 2026" "euclid-cli 1.0.53" "Euclid CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
euclid-cli-ens-get-topic-metadata \- show a topic's metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B euclid-cli ens get-topic-metadata
.BR \-\-topic | \-t
.I ERN
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the metadata of a topic identified by its Euclid resource name
(ERN): region, account ID, owner, namespace, name, ERN, size and total
message count.
.PP
.B Not yet implemented server-side in this release:
the ens service does not currently route this action to a handler, so
this command returns
.I "HTTP 404"
("Action not implemented: get-topic-metadata") regardless of arguments.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-topic " " \fIERN\fR
Euclid resource name of the topic to inspect. Required.
.PP
The topic may be given by
.B name
instead of by ERN, in which case it is resolved in your session's account
and namespace; see
.B NAMES AND ERNS
in
.BR euclid-cli-ens (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The topic's metadata is printed as JSON.
.TP
.B 1
Missing/invalid arguments, the server could not be reached, no topic
with that ERN exists, or (currently, always) the action is not yet
implemented server-side.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
euclid-cli --endpoint http://localhost:5566 ens get-topic-metadata \e
    --topic ern:ens:eu-central-1:000000000000:topic:order-events
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR euclid-cli-ens (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-get-topic-ern (1),
.BR euclid-cli-ens-get-message-count (1)
